<?xml version="1.0"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="thai_tax_invoice" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="160" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
            <label>Thai Tax Invoice</label>
            <tab>general</tab>
            <resource>Peerapatfc_ThaiTaxInvoice::config</resource>
            <group id="checkout" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="5" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Checkout</label>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Offer a full tax invoice</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Luma checkout, payment step. The buyer gives the name, tax ID and branch for the invoice; the address is the billing address.</comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="numbering" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Tax invoice numbers</label>
                <field id="prefix" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Prefix</label>
                    <comment>{Y} is the year as 2026 and {y} as 26. The running number starts again at 1 for each different prefix, so a year in the prefix starts a new series every January. Numbers have no gaps. Change it only before the first invoice of a period.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="padding" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Digits in the running number</label>
                    <comment>1 to 12. 6 gives INV2026-000001.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="auto_issue" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Issue when the order is invoiced</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>When Magento creates an invoice for an order that asked for a tax invoice, issue the tax invoice too. Off: use the button on the order. When a tax invoice must be issued (for example at payment or at delivery) is set by the Revenue Department, so check with your accountant.</comment>
                </field>
            </group>
            <group id="seller" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Seller (the business issuing the invoice)</label>
                <field id="name" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Registered name</label>
                    <comment>The name registered with the Revenue Department.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="tax_id" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Tax ID</label>
                    <backend_model>Peerapatfc\ThaiTaxInvoice\Model\Config\Backend\TaxId</backend_model>
                    <comment>13 digits. The check digit is verified when you save. Dashes and spaces are removed.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="branch" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Branch code</label>
                    <backend_model>Peerapatfc\ThaiTaxInvoice\Model\Config\Backend\Branch</backend_model>
                    <comment>5 digits. 00000 is the head office.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="address" translate="label" type="textarea" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Registered address</label>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
